<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Infernal Citadel — Five Rooms</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap');

        :root {
            --bg-deep: #050505;
            --bg-card: #0d0d0d;
            --accent: #c41e1e;
            --accent-glow: #ff2a2a;
            --text-main: #e8d5d5;
            --text-dim: #a08080;
            --border: #3a0a0a;
            --monster: #8b0000;
            --loot: #b8860b;
            --stat: #4a0000;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #1a0505 0%, transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, #120000 0%, transparent 70%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(2px 2px at 20% 30%, rgba(255, 40, 40, 0.3), transparent),
                radial-gradient(2px 2px at 40% 70%, rgba(255, 20, 20, 0.2), transparent),
                radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 40%, rgba(255, 60, 60, 0.25), transparent),
                radial-gradient(1px 1px at 60% 10%, rgba(255, 30, 30, 0.2), transparent);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            animation: drift 40s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes drift {
            0% { transform: translateY(0); }
            100% { transform: translateY(-100px); }
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px 40px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(40, 0, 0, 0.4), transparent);
        }

        header h1 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
            color: var(--accent-glow);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 40, 40, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(200, 0, 0, 0.5);
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-style: italic;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px 80px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .room {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(150, 0, 0, 0.15), inset 0 0 60px rgba(30, 0, 0, 0.4);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .room:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(200, 20, 20, 0.25), inset 0 0 80px rgba(40, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .room-header {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a0000, #2a0505, #1a0000);
            padding: 22px 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .room-number {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 40, 40, 0.6);
            min-width: 50px;
        }

        .room-title {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #ffcccc;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .room-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .room-body {
            padding: 30px 32px 36px;
        }

        .room-body p {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .feature-list {
            margin: 22px 0 10px;
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .feature-list li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            color: #d0b0b0;
        }

        .feature-list li::before {
            content: '◆';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            top: 4px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 40, 40, 0.7);
        }

        .hazards, .monsters, .loot, .stats {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
        }

        .hazards { background: rgba(80, 0, 0, 0.25); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); }
        .monsters { background: rgba(60, 0, 0, 0.35); border-left: 3px solid #8b0000; }
        .loot { background: rgba(40, 30, 0, 0.35); border-left: 3px solid #b8860b; }
        .stats { background: rgba(50, 0, 0, 0.4); border-left: 3px solid #660000; }

        .hazards strong, .monsters strong, .loot strong, .stats strong {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .hazards strong { color: var(--accent-glow); }
        .monsters strong { color: #ff5555; }
        .loot strong { color: #ffd700; }
        .stats strong { color: #ff6666; }

        .monster-list, .loot-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .monster-list li, .loot-list li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #e0b0b0;
        }

        .monster-list li::before { content: '☠'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #ff3333; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .loot-list li::before { content: '✦'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #ffd700; font-size: 0.9rem; }

        .stat-block {
            background: #120000;
            border: 1px solid #4a0000;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
        }

        .stat-block h4 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            color: #ff4444;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
        }

        .stat-block .meta { color: #cc8888; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .stat-block .line { margin: 3px 0; }
        .stat-block .label { color: #ffaaaa; font-weight: 600; }
        .cr { color: #ffcc00; font-weight: bold; }

        /* Loot Roll Button & Result */
        .roll-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 14px;
            padding: 10px 22px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5a3a00, #8b6500);
            color: #ffd700;
            border: 1px solid #ffd700;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .roll-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b6500, #c9a227);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .roll-result {
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            background: rgba(20, 15, 0, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid #b8860b;
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;
        }

        .roll-result.visible { display: block; }

        .roll-result h5 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            color: #ffd700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .roll-result ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .roll-result li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #e8d5a0;
        }

        .roll-result li::before {
            content: '✦';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: #ffd700;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        footer span { color: var(--accent); }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .room-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; }
            .room-body { padding: 22px 20px 28px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>THE INFERNAL CITADEL</h1>
    <p>Five chambers carved from the heart of the volcanic abyss</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <!-- ROOM 1 -->
    <article class="room" id="room1">
        <div class="room-header">
            <div class="room-number">I</div>
            <div>
                <div class="room-title">The Crimson Threshold</div>
                <div class="room-subtitle">Entrance Hall</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="room-body">
            <p>A vast, circular chamber roughly 80 feet across and 60 feet high. The glowing red portal you entered through sits at the top of a wide, cracked black-stone staircase that descends into the room. Concentric circles of ancient runes cover the entire floor; they pulse slowly with deep crimson light in time with a low, rhythmic thrum that seems to come from the fortress itself.</p>
            
            <p>Thin channels of glowing lava run along the base of the walls and cross the floor in geometric patterns, casting everything in shifting blood-red illumination. Four colossal statues of winged, horned figures stand against the walls—each 25 feet tall, carved from the same dark stone as the fortress, their eyes burning with actual fire. Between them, heavy iron-bound doors of black metal lead deeper into the citadel.</p>
            
            <p>The air is thick with heat and the sharp scent of sulfur and scorched stone. Distant roars and the constant rush of falling lava echo from below. The runes on the floor react to living creatures: they brighten when stepped on and leave faint glowing footprints that fade after a few seconds.</p>

            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Pulsing concentric runes that react to living presence</li>
                <li>Four 25-ft winged horned statues with burning eyes</li>
                <li>Lava channels forming geometric patterns across the floor</li>
                <li>Heavy iron-bound doors of black metal leading deeper</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="hazards">
                <strong>Hazards & Interaction</strong>
                A faint magical barrier shimmers across the main exit archway, requiring either a specific key, blood offering, or powerful magic to pass safely.
            </div>

            <div class="monsters">
                <strong>Monster Placements</strong>
                <ul class="monster-list">
                    <li><strong>4 Ashen Sentinels</strong> (CR 2)</li>
                    <li><strong>6 Ember Imps</strong> (CR 1)</li>
                    <li><strong>1 Portal Warden (Barbed Devil)</strong> (CR 5)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="stats">
                <strong>Monster Stat Blocks</strong>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Ashen Sentinel</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Medium construct, unaligned • <span class="cr">CR 2 (450 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 16 | <span class="label">HP</span> 45 (6d8+18) | <span class="label">Speed</span> 25 ft.</div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">STR</span> 16 (+3) | <span class="label">DEX</span> 8 (−1) | <span class="label">CON</span> 16 (+3)</div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">Immunities</span> fire, poison; nonmagical B/P/S</div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">Actions</span>: Multiattack (2 slams) • Slam +5 (2d6+3 bludgeoning)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Ember Imp</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Tiny fiend (devil), lawful evil • <span class="cr">CR 1 (200 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 13 | <span class="label">HP</span> 10 (3d4+3) | <span class="label">Speed</span> 20 ft., fly 40 ft.</div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">Actions</span>: Sting +5 (1d4+3 piercing + 1d6 fire) • Molten Spark +4 (2d6 fire, 30 ft.)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Portal Warden (Barbed Devil)</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Medium fiend (devil), lawful evil • <span class="cr">CR 5 (1,800 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 15 | <span class="label">HP</span> 110 (13d8+52) | <span class="label">Speed</span> 30 ft.</div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">Actions</span>: Multiattack (2 claws + 1 tail) • Claw +6 (1d6+3) • Tail +6 (2d6+3) • Hurl Flame +5 (3d6 fire)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="loot">
                <strong>Loot Table</strong>
                <ul class="loot-list">
                    <li><strong>Common (always)</strong>: 3d6 × 10 gp + 2 potions of fire resistance</li>
                    <li><strong>Uncommon (50%)</strong>: Black-iron key + +1 volcanic glass dagger</li>
                    <li><strong>Rare (20%)</strong>: Burning Eye (permanent torch, 1d6 fire if thrown)</li>
                    <li><strong>Hidden (DC 15)</strong>: Soul coins (1d4) + scroll of Protection from Evil and Good</li>
                </ul>
                <button class="roll-btn" onclick="rollLoot(1)">⚔ Roll Loot for this Room</button>
                <div class="roll-result" id="result1"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ROOM 2 -->
    <article class="room" id="room2">
        <div class="room-header">
            <div class="room-number">II</div>
            <div>
                <div class="room-title">The Vein Gallery</div>
                <div class="room-subtitle">Corridor of Flowing Magma</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="room-body">
            <p>A long, slightly curved corridor 120 feet in length, 20 feet wide, and 40 feet high. One entire long wall is formed of semi-transparent dark crystal or solidified magma glass, behind which a massive vertical river of bright red lava flows continuously...</p>

            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Semi-transparent crystal wall revealing a vertical lava river</li>
                <li>Three spiked-iron bridges spanning glowing chasms</li>
                <li>Inverted black spires dripping molten beads</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="hazards">
                <strong>Hazards & Interaction</strong>
                Extreme heat near the crystal wall. Occasional steam/lava sprays. Constant roar masks sound.
            </div>

            <div class="monsters">
                <strong>Monster Placements</strong>
                <ul class="monster-list">
                    <li><strong>3 Magma Mephits</strong> (CR 1/2)</li>
                    <li><strong>2 Lava Serpents</strong> (CR 3)</li>
                    <li><strong>1 Bridge Stalker (Shadow Demon)</strong> (CR 4)</li>
                    <li><strong>4 Cinder Spiders</strong> (CR 1/4)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="stats">
                <strong>Monster Stat Blocks</strong>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Magma Mephit</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Small elemental • <span class="cr">CR 1/2 (100 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 11 | <span class="label">HP</span> 21 | Death Burst 2d6 fire (DC 10 Dex)</div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">Actions</span>: Claws +3 (1d4+1 + 1d4 fire) • Fire Breath (Recharge 6) 2d6 fire, 15-ft cone</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Lava Serpent</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Large elemental • <span class="cr">CR 3 (700 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 14 | <span class="label">HP</span> 52 | Bite +5 (2d8+3 + 2d6 fire) • Lava Surge (Recharge 5-6) 4d6 fire, 20-ft line</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Bridge Stalker (Shadow Demon)</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Medium fiend (demon) • <span class="cr">CR 4 (1,100 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 13 | <span class="label">HP</span> 66 | Incorporeal • Claws +5 (2d6+3 psychic)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-block">
                    <h4>Cinder Spider</h4>
                    <div class="meta">Tiny beast • <span class="cr">CR 1/4 (50 XP)</span></div>
                    <div class="line"><span class="label">AC</span> 13 | <span class="label">HP</span> 7 | Bite +5 (1d4+3 + 1d6 fire + ongoing burn DC 11 Con)</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="loot">
                <strong>Loot Table</strong>
                <ul class="loot-list">
                    <li><strong>Common</strong>: 2d4 smoldering banners + 4d6 gp in cooled lava</li>
                    <li><strong>Uncommon (60%)</strong>: Boots of Lava Walking</li>
                    <li><strong>Rare (25%)</strong>: Crystal shard (+1 fire spell attacks)</li>
                    <li><strong>Hidden (DC 16)</strong>: Iron coffer (150 gp, greater healing potion, cursed ring)</li>
                </ul>
                <button class="roll-btn" onclick="rollLoot(2)">⚔ Roll Loot for this Room</button>
                <div class="roll-result" id="result2"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ROOM 3 -->
    <article class="room" id="room3">
        <div class="room-header">
            <div class="room-number">III</div>
            <div>
                <div class="room-title">The Ember Throne Room</div>
                <div class="room-subtitle">Seat of Power</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="room-body">
            <p>An immense rectangular hall 100 feet long, 60 feet wide, and over 80 feet high. The vaulted ceiling is lost in shadow... At the far end rises the Ember Throne...</p>

            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>The Ember Throne of living lava</li>
                <li>Red energy arcs between pillars</li>
                <li>Open balcony overlooking the abyss</li>
            </ul>

            <d